wards and crafting at this level range. Quest and crafted pieces are listed in the sections below.",keys={"priest-g277","priest-g56","priest-g12","priest-g304","priest-g29","priest-g273","priest-g295","priest-g267","priest-g287","priest-g108","priest-g322","priest-g115","priest-g61","priest-g313","priest-g285","priest-g39"}},{b="30-39",no="Best match per slot for Holy by stat priority, picked from dungeon drops, quest rewards and crafting at this level range. Quest and crafted pieces are listed in the sections below.",keys={"priest-g394","priest-g384","priest-g387","priest-g371","priest-g42","priest-g355","priest-g369","priest-g356","priest-g121","priest-g333","priest-g385","priest-g370","priest-g377","priest-g350","priest-g352"}},{b="40-49",no="Best match per slot for Holy by stat priority, picked from dungeon drops, quest rewards and crafting at this level range. Quest and crafted pieces are listed in the sections below.",keys={"priest-g434","priest-g487","priest-g472","priest-g486","priest-g416","priest-g439","priest-g458","priest-g460","priest-g443","priest-g484","priest-g407","priest-g57","priest-g465","priest-g436","priest-g480","priest-g422","priest-g450"}},{b="50-60",no="Best match per slot for Holy by stat priority, picked from dungeon drops, quest rewards and crafting at this level range. Quest and crafted pieces are listed in the sections below.",keys={"priest-g608","priest-g594","priest-g578","priest-g606","priest-g615","priest-g180","priest-g531","priest-g524","priest-g583","priest-g521","priest-g64","priest-g9","priest-g135","priest-g540","priest-g613","priest-g604","priest-g114","priest-g644"}}},title="Holy | WoW Forever Priest Field Guide",nav={{id="overview",x=S[552]},{id="journey",x=S[446]},{id="talents",x=S[392]},{id="stats",x=S[477]},{id="combat",x=S[478]},{id="macros",x=S[479]},{id="dungeons",x=S[420]},{id="professions",x=S[447]},{id="crafting",x=S[431]},{id="questgear",x=S[412]},{id=S[388],x=S[522]}},asideNote=S[72],talentString="02300500103000000033205101032021531005",ranks={{tree="Discipline",name=S[402],r=2,max=2},{tree="Discipline",name=S[442],r=3,max=5},{tree="Discipline",name=S[339],r=5,max=5},{tree="Discipline",name="Inner Focus",r=1,max=1},{tree="Discipline",name="Meditation",r=3,max=3},{tree="Holy",name=S[471],r=3,max=3},{tree="Holy",name=S[602],r=3,max=3},{tree="Holy",name=S[403],r=2,max=5},{tree="Holy",name="Divine Fury",r=5,max=5},{tree="Holy",name="Holy Nova",r=1,max=1},{tree="Holy",name="Inspiration",r=1,max=3},{tree="Holy",name=S[591],r=3,max=3},{tree="Holy",name=S[609],r=2,max=2},{tree="Holy",name=S[598],r=2,max=2},{tree="Holy",name=S[548],r=1,max=1},{tree="Holy",name=S[414],r=5,max=5},{tree="Holy",name=S[588],r=3,max=3},{tree="Holy",name=S[505],r=1,max=1},{tree="Shadow",name="Spirit Tap",r=5,max=5}},order={{l1=10,l2=11,tree="Discipline",name=S[402],r1=1,r2=2,max=2},{l1=12,l2=16,tree="Shadow",name="Spirit Tap",r1=1,r2=5,max=5},{l1=17,l2=19,tree="Holy",name=S[471],r1=1,r2=3,max=3},{l1=20,l2=22,tree="Holy",name=S[602],r1=1,r2=3,max=3},{l1=23,l2=25,tree="Discipline",name=S[442],r1=1,r2=3,max=5},{l1=26,l2=30,tree="Discipline",name=S[339],r1=1,r2=5,max=5},{l1=31,l2=33,tree="Discipline",name="Meditation",r1=1,r2=3,max=3},{l1=34,l2=37,tree="Holy",name="Divine Fury",r1=1,r2=4,max=5},{l1=38,l2=38,tree="Holy",name="Holy Nova",r1=1,r2=1,max=1},{l1=39,l2=39,tree="Holy",name="Inspiration",r1=1,r2=1,max=3},{l1=40,l2=40,tree="Holy",name="Divine Fury",r1=5,r2=5,max=5},{l1=41,l2=42,tree="Holy",name=S[403],r1=1,r2=2,max=5},{l1=43,l2=44,tree="Holy",name=S[609],r1=1,r2=2,max=2},{l1=45,l2=47,tree="Holy",name=S[591],r1=1,r2=3,max=3},{l1=48,l2=48,tree="Holy",name=S[548],r1=1,r2=1,max=1},{l1=49,l2=50,tree="Holy",name=S[598],r1=1,r2=2,max=2},{l1=51,l2=52,tree="Holy",name=S[414],r1=1,r2=2,max=5},{l1=53,l2=55,tree="Holy",name=S[588],r1=1,r2=3,max=3},{l1=56,l2=57,tree="Holy",name=S[414],r1=3,r2=4,max=5},{l1=58,l2=58,tree="Holy",name=S[505],r1=1,r2=1,max=1},{l1=59,l2=59,tree="Holy",name=S[414],r1=5,r2=5,max=5},{l1=60,l2=60,tree="Discipline",name="Inner Focus",r1=1,r2=1,max=1}},blocks={{t="anchor",id="overview"},{t="p",s="eyebrow",x=S[413]},{t="h1",x="Holy",sub=S[481]},{t="p",s="lede",x="Reactive group healing: Renew, Heal and Flash Heal for the tank, Prayer of Mending bouncing through the party, Litany of Light refunding mana, and Holy Nova when Searing Light makes it free."},{t="pills",list={S[520],"Dungeon and group healing",S[448]}},{t="anchor",id="journey"},{t="kicker",x=S[553]},{t="h2",x=S[355]},{t="p",x="These stages follow the talent order below. Holy is the easier healing tree to pick up; it levels best in groups, and Holy Nova gives it the only area damage a Priest has."},{t="p",s="level",x=S[547]},{t="p",x="Shoot with a wand between spells; Power Word: Shield arrives at 6 and Renew at 8. Wand Specialization 2/2 at 11, Spirit Tap 5/5 by 16 and Twilight Focus 3/3 by 19 make solo questing smoother and protect your casts from pushback."},{t="p",s="level",x="20–39 · Renew and efficiency"},{t="p",x="Improved Renew 3/3 by 22 adds 15% to Renew, Twin Disciplines 3/5 by 25 adds 3% to instant spells, Mental Strength 5/5 by 30 adds 10% Intellect, and Meditation 3/3 by 33 lets half of your mana regeneration continue while casting. Divine Fury follows, with Holy Nova at 38 and Inspiration at 39."},{t="p",s="level",x="40–60 · Spirit and Mending"},{t="p",x="Divine Fury reaches 5/5 at 40 (with Greater Heal), then Holy Specialization, Searing Light (free Holy Nova procs from Holy Fire), Improved Healing (15% cheaper heals), Spirit of Redemption at 48 and Litany of Light 2/2 by 50. Spiritual Guidance and Spiritual Healing fill 51–59, Prayer of Mending arrives at 58 and Inner Focus completes the build at 60."},{t="anchor",id="talents"},{t="kicker",x=S[393]},{t="h2",x=S[520]},{t="p",x=S[60]},{t="widget",w="talents"},{t="h4",s="summary",x=S[421]},{t="widget",w="ranks"},{t="h4",s="summary",x=S[375]},{t="p",x=S[144]},{t="widget",w="order"},{t="p",s="notice",x="Holy Binding (Flash Heal heals you for 50% as much) is an option if you take damage while healing; this build does not take it. Litany of Light refunds 10% of a heal’s base mana cost when your previous heal was a different spell, and Spiritual Guidance turns 25% of your Spirit into healing power."},{t="anchor",id="stats"},{t="kicker",x=S[482]},{t="h2",x=S[405]},{t="p",x="Holy wants healing power first, then the mana stats that keep you casting. Spiritual Guidance turns Spirit into extra healing."},{t="h3",x=S[538]},{t="stat",i=1,b=S[578],x=S[579]},{t="stat",i=2,b="Intellect",x=S[565]},{t="stat",i=3,b="Spirit",x="also adds healing with Spiritual Guidance"},{t="stat",i=4,b="Stamina",x=""},{t="stat",i=5,b=S[498],x=S[613]},{t="p",s="small",x="Holy levels best in groups; keep a healing set for dungeons."},{t="h3",x="At level 60"},{t="stat",i=1,b=S[498],x=""},{t="stat",i=2,b="Mana per 5",x=""},{t="stat",i=3,b="Spirit",x=""},{t="stat",i=4,b="Intellect",x=""},{t="stat",i=5,b=S[523],x=""},{t="p",s="small",x="Critical strike is last because a crit often overheals. Some estimates put Intellect second."},{t="p",s="notice",x=S[75]},{t="anchor",id="combat"},{t="kicker",x=S[406]},{t="h2",x=S[432]},{t="p",x="Treat this as a priority list, not a fixed loop. Heal arrives at 16, Flash Heal at 20, Holy Nova at 38, Greater Heal at 40 and Prayer of Mending at 58 in this order."},{t="h4",x=S[466]},{t="p",x="Keep Power Word: Fortitude and Inner Fire up, and Divine Spirit from 30. Shield yourself or the tank before the pull."},{t="h4",x="Solo damage"},{t="p",x="Holy Fire on the furthest or priority target, Smite as it approaches, then Mind Blast and Shadow Word: Pain, and finish with your wand. Against several enemies, use Holy Nova when Searing Light makes it free."},{t="h4",x="Renew and Prayer of Mending"},{t="p",x="Keep Renew on the tank while they take steady damage; several Priests’ Renews can share a target in Forever. Place Prayer of Mending on whoever is about to take damage so it heals and jumps through the group."},{t="h4",x="Heal and Greater Heal"},{t="p",x="Heal (Greater Heal from 40) for moderate healing after a few seconds. Use lower ranks so you do not overheal; alternating different heals triggers Litany of Light refunds."},{t="h4",x="Emergencies"},{t="p",x="Power Word: Shield buys time, Flash Heal is the fast but expensive answer, and Prayer of Healing heals the whole party when everyone is hurt. Inner Focus makes one big heal free."},{t="h4",x=S[580]},{t="p",x="Dispel Magic and Cure Disease (Abolish Disease from 32) when the effect is worth removing. Fade if enemies turn to you."},{t="abil",names={"Renew","Heal","Greater Heal","Flash Heal",S[505],"Prayer of Healing","Holy Nova",S[581],"Inner Focus"}},{t="h3",x=S[467]},{t="p",x="Priority for Holy: healing power, mana per 5 seconds, Spirit (Spiritual Guidance turns it into healing), Intellect, and critical strike last, since a crit often just overheals."},{t="p",x="A strong wand is your main damage source until the mid-30s: Novice’s Practice Wand (1), Lesser Magic Wand (5) and Greater Magic Wand (13) from Enchanting, then Gravestone Scepter from Blackfathom Deeps. Learn Staves at a weapon master before your first staff."},{t="h3",x=S[422]},{t="p",x="Heal with lower ranks to avoid overhealing, alternate different heals for Litany of Light, and let Renew finish before refreshing it. Keep enough mana for an emergency Flash Heal."},{t="p",x="Spirit of Redemption keeps you healing for 15 seconds after death. Every Priest learns Fear Ward and Devouring Plague at 20 and Divine Spirit at 30 in Forever."},{t="anchor",id="macros"},{t="kicker",x=S[483]},{t="h2",x=S[340]},{t="p",x=S[52]},{t="p",s="notice",x=S[53]},{t="macro",n=S[389],x=S[86],code=S[146]},{t="macro",n=S[524],x=S[105],code=S[196]},{t="macro",n=S[460],x=S[117],code=S[171]},{t="macro",n=S[356],x=S[97],code=S[136]},{t="macro",n=S[433],x=S[113],code=S[162]},{t="macro",n=S[468],x=S[161],code=S[175]},{t="macro",n=S[348],x=S[152],code=S[390]},{t="macro",n=S[434],x=S[184],code=S[195]},{t="macro",n=S[461],x=S[192],code=S[289]},{t="macro",n="Mouseover Prayer of Mending",x="Places Prayer of Mending on the ally under your pointer, your friendly target or yourself. Put it on someone about to take damage.",code="#showtooltip Prayer of Mending\n/cast [@mouseover,help,nodead][help,nodead][@player] Prayer of Mending"},{t="macro",n="Greater Heal, Shift for Rank 1",x="Normal press casts your highest Greater Heal; Shift casts Rank 1 for a smaller, cheaper heal. Learned at 40.",code="#showtooltip Greater Heal\n/cast [mod:shift,@mouseover,help,nodead][mod:shift,help,nodead][mod:shift,@player] Greater Heal(Rank 1); [@mouseover,help,nodead][help,nodead][@player] Greater Heal"},{t="macro",n="Inner Focus and Greater Heal",x="Makes the next Greater Heal free with 25% more critical chance, on the ally under your pointer, your friendly target or yourself.",code="#showtooltip Inner Focus\n/cast Inner Focus\n/cast [@mouseover,help,nodead][help,nodead][@player] Greater Heal"},{t="macro",n="Holy Nova",x="Damages enemies and heals party members within 10 yards. Best when Searing Light makes it free.",code="#showtooltip Holy Nova\n/cast Holy Nova"},{t="p",s="small",x=S[226]},{t="anchor",id="dungeons"},{t="kicker",x=S[525]},{t="h2",x=S[376]},{t="p",x=S[55]},{t="widget",w="rarity"},{t="p",s="notice",x=S[56]},{t="p",s="notice",x=S[29]},{t="widget",w="loot"},{t="anchor",id="professions"},{t="kicker",x=S[407]},{t="h2",x=S[373]},{t="p",x=S[66]},{t="widget",w="prof"},{t="anchor",id="crafting"},{t="kicker",x=S[423]},{t="h2",x=S[357]},{t="p",x=S[25]},{t="widget",w="craft"},{t="anchor",id="questgear"},{t="kicker",x=S[408]},{t="h2",x=S[332]},{t="p",x=S[28]},{t="widget",w="quest"},{t="anchor",id=S[388]},{t="kicker",x=S[526]},{t="h2",x="Your notes"},{t="widget",w="notes"},{t="p",s="small",x=S[87]}}},{id="shadow",name="Shadow",token="SHADOW",gearBrackets={{b="Quest rewards",no="Quest rewards that fit this spec's stat priority, sorted by quest level. The tooltip names the q